{"reviewId": "259153360_86VYtUsFA", "review": {"abstract": "中日参与国际化分工的方式不同，中国参与以生产要素为基础的国际分工，承担劳动密集型部分的生产。而日本参与以产品为基础的国际分工，注重独立的品牌", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "chapterUid": 10, "content": "还是日本走的高级呀！国际分工一开始就是独立品牌享受更多生产红利，而中国就是苦哈哈的牛马赚点劳务费，大部头被美欧企业拿走了，后面日本双泡沫“失去了三十年”可算独立品牌陷阱🤣", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "3330-3400", "createTime": 1771143556, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 10, "reviewId": "259153360_86VYtUsFA", "userVid": 259153360, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "author": {"userVid": 259153360, "name": "十八°", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/9rbfnVicX3WUZz3nGMicFic2Wp0yticks1oAhdjsGDKDicRGgpZrqYkaUE7iaibGONEdJ1ic2ygo4EDvxOk/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "十八°", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一本时差被打断的书", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "惜字如金～", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 347035781, "name": "captain tom", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/vhWQqM7UgvAmIBcZk99HUrxJAM4FwVw6hXnwUOsLSlL2VcuCDfLFYug6doURxlK9QRvf0M5U6T2vkfZ4bmZrCicG51TKibEABW8obicfVMLMu0/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc